2026-05-21 18:01:37.951 | DEBUG    | urllib3.connectionpool:_make_request:1461 | https://translate.google.com:443 "GET /m?tl=ru&sl=auto&q=When+an+attack+lands+within+the+shield%27s+deflect+arc+and+the+block+attempt+succeeds%2C+the+shield%27s+sharp+armor+rating+is+compared+against+the+attacker%27s+armor+penetration%3A+threshold+%3D+max%28Shield+Armor+-+Attacker+AP%2C+0%29+A+random+roll+from+0+to+1+is+then+made%3A+-+If+the+roll+is+below+the+threshold%2C+the+attack+is+fully+blocked+and+deals+no+damage.+-+If+the+roll+meets+or+exceeds+the+threshold%2C+the+attack+fully+penetrates+%E2%80%94+the+shield+has+no+effect. HTTP/2.0" 200 None

